===== en | 160x60 | menu =====

what would you like to do?

> cast           browse the authored characters, at any level
  skills         look a skill up: what each does, and who may carry it
  elements       look the chart up: what it beats, what beats it, at what rate
  traits         look a trait up: what each does, and who learns it
  species        look a kind up: what each one means
  origins        look a work up: the fictions the cast is borrowed from
  squad bonuses  the thresholds a squad is paid for, and what each one grants
  squads         the sides that have been built, and take one into a battle
  battle         play a battle yourself, with the first side on the list
  join a room    paste the code a friend sent and play them over the local network

A battle here is fought out of the directory above, while the game boots from
the embedded copy — rebuild before an edit reaches one. In a battle, ctrl+s
writes the log that hexarena --replay draws that same battle back from.








































